{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the wilderness and protect your calf and your herd from lurking predators and the looming threat of starvation. Make your way through the open landscapes as a majestic elephant.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About <strong>Shelter 3</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With so many mouths to feed, your journey will be a hard one. Use ancient knowledge to navigate through the world and discover new terrain and untrodden pathways, gaining wisdom as you do so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware that you will need to make hard choices along the way. In the wild, all living creatures are put to the test and as an elephant, you\u2019re not a predator but prey.  Be alert and gather your herd during times of danger. Your herd is your family, shelter is your only hope, and survival your only goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Different Kind of Animal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shelter 3 is a game where wisdom, empathy and leadership play an important role in your survival. Like its forebears, Shelter 3 invites you to inhabit the spirit of an animal. But where Shelter 2 centred on a lone lynx family, Shelter 3 lets you explore a different kind of animal existence as an elephant, where community is as important as family, and unity is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Landscapes and fauna are rendered in mesmerising patterns and scored with an enchanting soundtrack by Retro Family, conjuring a magical world to lose yourself in. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This new Shelter incarnation migrates to new territory and offers a new, magical experience that you won\u2019t forget.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"038b8f96c23d5607521b7b3b78055db42cd68463.jpg","localized_name":"A Good Mother","name":"A Good Mother","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/977630/038b8f96c23d5607521b7b3b78055db42cd68463.jpg"},{"icon":"982a33fb0875342e55f976f031f591a834d93c14.jpg","localized_name":"Timber!","name":"Timber!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/977630/982a33fb0875342e55f976f031f591a834d93c14.jpg"},{"icon":"97b936ffbf60ae572f9c02ebb1cc03e615e1a112.jpg","localized_name":"Thirst Quencher","name":"Thirst Quencher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/977630/97b936ffbf60ae572f9c02ebb1cc03e615e1a112.jpg"},{"icon":"080d1204d5fc3a4893a74066722244dcb09a917f.jpg","localized_name":"In the Ancestor's Footsteps","name":"In the Ancestor's Footsteps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/977630/080d1204d5fc3a4893a74066722244dcb09a917f.jpg"},{"icon":"c4f3bd10a7d86118b2c63355044be6e1b9479423.jpg","localized_name":"Flamboyant Flight","name":"Flamboyant Flight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/977630/c4f3bd10a7d86118b2c63355044be6e1b9479423.jpg"},{"icon":"d2f837787ac08bd9e0f77f96594ecf8549315f4c.jpg","localized_name":"Pretty Pick","name":"Pretty Pick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/977630/d2f837787ac08bd9e0f77f96594ecf8549315f4c.jpg"},{"icon":"0598b030ed0bdeb557986518c4e683724aca6a34.jpg","localized_name":"The Journey's End","name":"The Journey's End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/977630/0598b030ed0bdeb557986518c4e683724aca6a34.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/977630?t=1747743267","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977630/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747743267","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977630/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747743267","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/977630/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747743267","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descriptio